can recover from failures quickly, minimizing downtime. Low change failure rate suggests that most changes are successful, indicating a mature and stable DevOps environment.\n\n5. DevSecOps integrates automated security testing into the CI/CD pipeline to ensure that security is built into the development process from the start. This includes tools like static code analysis, dynamic application security testing, and automated vulnerability scanning. By embedding security practices into the development lifecycle, DevSecOps helps prevent security issues before they reach production, enhancing both efficiency and security.",
