 into the CI/CD pipeline to ensure that security is embedded throughout the development process. This approach involves tools like static code analysis, dynamic application security testing (DAST), and infrastructure as code (IaC) scanning to identify and address vulnerabilities early. By prioritizing security at every stage, DevSecOps helps maintain the integrity and security of software systems while supporting continuous delivery.",
